// app/data/serviceSeeds/plumbing.js
//
// The service list a plumbing company starts from. Read ./index.js for the
// format and the rules. The plumbing line-item catalogue
// (app/data/plumbingCatalog.js) already ships the LIST of habitual lines
// without prices; where a seed matches one of those, `existing` says so, and
// the two coexist — the catalogue feeds the builder's chips, these become
// priced Products.
//
// Written in source order (two industries: the plumbing book, then the
// water-heater book) so scripts/service-seeds/authoring/gen-source-map.mjs
// can join each row back for the owner's validation.
